>Is there an easy way in software with DEC UNIX 4.0 to stripe
>(raid 0) a couple disks into one large virtual partition?

Yes there is. You can use LSM (Logical Storage Manager) to do exactly
that. Take a look at the online HTML documentation on LSM and how to
set it up - it is _very_ complicated, but also very effective.

