: How do you get a 10/100mb dec tulip to run at 100mb on this card? I have
: no documentation and am trying to install this card, any help would be
: appreciated.

This Card actually has a man page for it's driver.  man tu

You'll end up having to set a boot prom environment variable.  You can
get to the boot prom level by issuing a shutdown -h.  After you set
the variable, reboot.  If you get a list of environment variables,
you'll see some of the form "ew*0_mode" One will allow you to select
the speed (hopefully it will be obvious which one).

Sorry I can't be more specific, but I can't affort to take down any
Unix machines which I have access to in order to poke around the prom
level.

Hope this helps.
	
