VR-299 at 1024 X 864
VRT-19HA (or Sony GDM-1961) at 1152 X 870 approx.

I have been having more success with the older VR-299 at switch setting 7 (dial 
on graphics card), but no resolution seems to work on the VRT-19HA.
Whats even more staggering, is that the VRT-19HA works perfect in text and 
graphics modes on HP PA-RISC machines.
Can anyone contribute as to which graphics cards in the DEC compatibility 
product line would support this monitor (VRT-19HA).

Thanks for any assistance.






